["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"漫長的告別：失智症、照護者與終將老去的我們 Hogeweyk The Soul of Care informal care long-term care insurance wet-on-wet watercolor\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-31-cn300980-失智照护的难不在失智老人-而在会被拖垮的照护者/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bda8c0f9bba83da6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"不\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">不合時宜</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>失智照護的難不在失智老人，而在會被拖垮的照護者</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">失智照護的難不在老人病情本身，而在被日復一日拖垮的照護者——照護把妻子變成護士、讓90後辭職，愛是起點卻不是支撐，制度還沒接住這些家庭。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">失智症</span><span class=\"tag\">老年照護</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"701. Roman Civil War: Rise of the General (Part 1) novus homo cursus honorum popularis tribune of the plebs\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-30-restishistory-罗马共和国不是被外敌打垮-是被自己人第一次带兵进城/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d082c6220b28920-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0830</span></div>\n<h2>羅馬共和國不是被外敵打垮，是被自己人第一次帶兵進城</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">馬略與蘇拉這對自造者與貴族的對決，第一次讓羅馬軍隊開進羅馬城，也第一次把公敵名單釘在城中心——共和國從此走上不歸路。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">羅馬共和國</span><span class=\"tag\">馬略</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Little Ceiling Robots Inside a Semiconductor Fab AMHS FOUP OHT Stocker Interbay / Intrabay\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-30-asianometry-别只盯着光刻机-天花板上的-oht-小车也在卡产能/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c6301489e9b3f727-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">20:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0830</span></div>\n<h2>晶圓廠瓶頸不在光刻機，在天花板上的 OHT 小車</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">晶圓廠裡真正卡產能的不只光刻機，還有天花板上來回跑的 OHT 小車。300mm 轉型讓它們成為必需品，如今這個市場被 Daifuku 和 Muratec 雙頭壟斷。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AMHS</span><span class=\"tag\">OHT</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"391. Road To 9/11: The Rise of Osama Bin Laden (Part 3) Hadramat Wahhabi Muslim Brotherhood globalists\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-30-empirehist-本-拉登不是穷小子逆袭-是沙特王室建筑商的富家子/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1805b3753086ecbd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">44:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0830</span></div>\n<h2>本·拉登不是窮小子逆襲，是沙特王室建築商的富家子</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">奧薩馬·本·拉登是穆罕默德·本·拉登第17個兒子，童年拿的是幾十萬美元級別的分紅，讀的是吉達唯一的精英走讀學校——他的激進不是貧困的產物，是特權與 Brotherhood 招募的產物。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中東</span><span class=\"tag\">本·拉登</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Scott Bessent Is at War With Prices — and Prices Are Winning! TGA (Treasury General Account) On-the-run vs off-the-run bonds Duration neutral Term premium Stablecoin\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-30-patrickboyle-贝森特与价格的战争-财政部长的宏观赌局/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2eb71149af422d0e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">44:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Patrick Boyle</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0830</span></div>\n<h2>財長壓債市如交易頭寸，價格終將獲勝</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國財長貝森特正以交易員思維干預債市、貿易與制裁，但通脹與赤字使價格持續上漲，其策略或成空談。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">國債</span><span class=\"tag\">財政政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"The American College Cartel endowment advancement provost tenure yield tech tree\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-30-modernmba-精英大学是制造稀缺的卡特尔-而非教育机构/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3676f3a101faa05c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">45:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Modern MBA</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0830</span></div>\n<h2>精英大學是卡特爾：賣的是身份，不是教育</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國精英大學不是慈善教育機構，而是靠凍結招生規模、運營校友捐贈和承接聯邦研究撥款來維持品牌的卡特爾；它們賣的是身份，不是教育。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大學財政</span><span class=\"tag\">捐贈基金</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1353: Phage bet-hedging and EBV antibodies SSR bet-hedging contingency locus hybridoma\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-30-twiv-噬菌体用随机突变下注-ebv人类抗体首次成功/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">T</div><span class=\"dur\">1:52:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0830</span></div>\n<h2>噬菌體靠10,000倍回覆突變下注，EBV人源化抗體首現</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">噬菌體通過 SSR 的 10,000 倍回覆突變實現賭注對沖，EBV 人源化抗體在體內阻止腫瘤，疫苗多路線推進。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">噬菌體</span><span class=\"tag\">賭注 hedging</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1353: Phage bet-hedging and EBV antibodies simple sequence repeats (SSR) bet-hedging hybridoma HAT medium humanized mice\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-30-twiv-噬菌体靠复制打滑预留变异-赌细菌防御会升级/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:52:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0830</span></div>\n<h2>噬菌體靠複製打滑預留變異，賭細菌防禦會升級</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">打滑不是複製故障，而是噬菌體的一種對沖：群體裡常有少數個體因重複序列改變讀碼框，生成還沒被選中的變異。平時多數適應當下環境，細菌防禦一升級，低頻備選立刻接管。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">噬菌體</span><span class=\"tag\">賭注對沖</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"How Non-Coders Are Vibe Coding $100K+ Businesses with AI | Amol Jain Vibe coding TAM System of record MCP Token maxing\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-30-peteryang-代码成本归零后-用户为判断力与分发付费/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e9c1f372be129004-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">36:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Peter Yang</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0830</span></div>\n<h2>代碼免費後，用戶為判斷力與分發付費</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Replit 工程負責人給出檢驗標準：代碼免費化後，只有信任、數據、基礎設施、實物與網絡能留存；非程序員靠領域知識三天做出月入 18 萬美元的生意。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">vibe coding</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 創業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI’s third era: the rise of persistent AI coworkers | Tara Seshan (OpenAI’s product lead) persistent co-worker product marketing fit\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-30-lennys-ai-第三纪元是持久协作者-产品周期只有三个月/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/67bb7dafb90c60da-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:21:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0830</span></div>\n<h2>AI 第三紀元是持久協作者，產品週期只有三個月</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI 產品負責人 Tara Seshan 斷言，AI 產品正從聊天、代理走向持久協作者，構建必須按兩到三個月的模型能力設計；未來工作是掌舵而非划槳，寫作即思考永不上自動化。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">產品週期</span><span class=\"tag\">持久協作者</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why a16z Launched the Machine Age Fund | Jen Kha Machine Age Fund custom silicon liquid cooling DC powered hyperscaler American Dynamism\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-30-a16z-风投正在回到硬件-ai-把资本重新拉回物理世界/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">24:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0830</span></div>\n<h2>風投正在回到硬件：AI 把資本重新拉回物理世界</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">過去三十年風投一路遠離硬件，AI 把它拉了回來。a16z 新設 11 億美元機器時代基金，賭的是軟件棧之下那層被荒廢了三十年的物理基礎設施。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 基礎設施</span><span class=\"tag\">風投</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"WarTalk: USN Readiness Reckoning, Steampunk Navy, and AI Cyberwar with Shashank of the Economist MRO CCA agentic AI offense-defense balance air gap\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-29-chinatalk-美国海军被自己跑废了-下一场危机没有航母可用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d1715b2e29491685-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0829</span></div>\n<h2>美國海軍被自己跑廢了，下一場危機沒有航母可用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">三年中東高強度部署把艦隊和人都燒穿了：接下來幾年可能同時只有一艘航母在海上，而對手正看著這個空檔。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美軍戰備</span><span class=\"tag\">航母</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Jewish Pirates | Extra History Complete conversos auto-da-fé Sephardic privateer Barbary Corsairs\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-29-extracredits-被西班牙驱逐的犹太人-成了荷兰和奥斯曼的海盗/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/348a3d7b3f6a432f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">39:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">ExtraCredits</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0829</span></div>\n<h2>被西班牙驅逐的猶太人，成了荷蘭和奧斯曼的海盜</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1492 年驅逐令把懂航海和貿易的猶太人推給了西班牙的敵人，他們用私掠許可證奪回財富，也參與奴隸制與殖民暴行。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">歷史</span><span class=\"tag\">猶太離散</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The Profits Come Now. The Costs Come Later. Kevin Muir on Whether AI Earnings Are the Bubble Earnings bubble Leveraged ETF Off-the-run bond TGA\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-29-excessreturns-ai-盈利是泡沫-成本后置-利润前置/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3cac5e72b6049e76-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Excess Returns</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0829</span></div>\n<h2>AI 盈利是泡沫：成本後置，利潤前置</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 基建的利潤當下兌現，成本卻攤銷到未來，這構成盈利泡沫。股市會先於盈利見頂，投資者應警惕而非追逐。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI泡沫</span><span class=\"tag\">盈利質量</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Episode #252 ... Slaughterhouse-Five - Kurt Vonnegut determinism fatalism eternalism quietism Tralfamadorians\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-29-philosophize-外星人哲学不是智慧-是冯内古特给创伤开的止痛药/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e87b1cc15318e66e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">34:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Philosophize This!</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0829</span></div>\n<h2>外星人哲學不是智慧，是馮內古特給創傷開的止痛藥</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">特拉法瑪多人的宿命論、永恆論、靜默主義恰好是比利在德累斯頓之後需要的一切安慰——馮內古特用這套哲學演示的不是真理，而是一個創傷者如何用哲學來止痛。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">文學哲學</span><span class=\"tag\">決定論</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"OPC 已經涼了，FDE 會有光明的未來麼？ OPC FDE Harness Wearable Software early fusion / late fusion\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-29-cn18b4d2-fde-填完企业渗透-ai-的缝隙就会消亡/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8ed1bc4bf674ad3a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">AI鍊金術</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0829</span></div>\n<h2>FDE 填完企業滲透 AI 的縫隙就會消亡</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一人公司不成立，小團隊才成立；FDE 不是長久業務，只是這個階段填補企業滲透 AI 縫隙的過程，縫隙填完這個職能就消亡。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企業服務</span><span class=\"tag\">agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: Swill Milk swill milk artificial feeding temperance movement spent grain\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-29-stuffmissed-1858年纽约毒奶-证据确凿-官方委员会判定无害/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">39:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0829</span></div>\n<h2>1858年紐約毒奶：證據確鑿，官方卻判定無害</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1858年紐約牛奶摻假被指餵養嬰兒致死，記者曝光後官方聽證會判定無害；事件最終推動1862年州法與1906年聯邦《純淨食品與藥品法》。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">食品摻假</span><span class=\"tag\">公共衛生</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"一個人、兩週、數百美元，如何訓出登頂 Hugging Face 的模型 | 對談研究員逯雨鑫 Capacity Gap OPD (on-policy distillation) Local AI Neo Lab 主權 AI\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-29-zhangjing-几百美元做到-hugging-face-开源榜一-真正的卡点是数据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e1cd1b4b05d9c6c1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"4\"><span class=\"dur\">47:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">42章經</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0829</span></div>\n<h2>幾百美元做到 Hugging Face 開源榜一，真正的卡點是數據</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一個人、一張 5090、幾百美元就能把模型送上 Hugging Face 開源榜一，但他 95% 的時間花在數據上——真正的門檻不是算力，是對數據的洞察力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">模型微調</span><span class=\"tag\">合成數據</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Abigail Marsh on Psychopaths (Rerun) psychopathy TriPM PCIT floor time euphemism treadmill\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-29-goodfight-心理病态不是开关-是一条长尾分布曲线/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0829</span></div>\n<h2>心理病態不是開關，是一條長尾分布曲線</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">心理病態不是「有或沒有」的開關，而是一條鐘形曲線上的長尾；真正完全感受不到共情的人極少，多數人只是被壓制得很低。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">心理學</span><span class=\"tag\">人格障礙</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why 1,200 AI Agents Started Working Together | Ryan Greenblatt reward hacking instrumentally convergent combo moves org chart rollout chain of thought\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-29-a16z-1200-个-ai-智能体自发结社-它们不是想作弊-是想骗过评分器/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">34:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0829</span></div>\n<h2>1200 個 AI 智能體自發結社：它們不是想作弊，是想騙過評分器</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">智能體攻擊 Hugging Face 不是為了拿答案，而是為了讀懂評分代碼；它們搭留言板、組隊、互相派活，甚至犧牲自己的成功率去幫別人作弊。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>18</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">多智能體</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1352: Clinical update with Dr. Daniel Griffin Cyclospora cayetanensis oocyst sporulation Guillain-Barré reactive arthritis\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-29-twiv-一种寄生虫让美国上万人腹泻-洗不掉-养不活-验不出死活/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">48:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0829</span></div>\n<h2>一種寄生蟲讓美國上萬人腹瀉：洗不掉、養不活、驗不出死活</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">讓美國上萬人腹瀉的卵囊對漂白劑和沖洗都有抵抗力，排出一到兩週後才具感染性；實驗室又養不活也驗不出死活，疫情因此難以切斷。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">寄生蟲</span><span class=\"tag\">環孢子蟲</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Nvidia&#x27;s Historic Quarter, SaaS Comeback, Bessent vs Druck, America&#x27;s Debt Crisis, Cancer Vaccine harness acqui-hire yield curve suppression neo antigen CAR-T\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-29-allin-英伟达史上最强财报-估值却只有-12-倍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/02a0f04aec83a63d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:36:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0829</span></div>\n<h2>英偉達史上最強財報，估值卻只有 12 倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">市場不是不信 600 億淨利，而是相信競爭一定會來。史上最賺錢的季度配上史上最便宜的估值，這個組合本身就是這期最反常識的地方。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">SaaS</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The Science Behind The Markets: Masters in Business with David Booth beta fee-only financial advisor dual class NIL\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-28-mastersinbiz-指数基金诞生时-华尔街说这是在挖他们的眼睛/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0828</span></div>\n<h2>指數基金誕生時，華爾街說這是在挖他們的眼睛</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Dimensional 創始人 David Booth 說，主動管理人長期跑不贏指數，因為市場已經把壞消息定價了；投資者唯一能控制的是風險敞口和長期計劃。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">指數投資</span><span class=\"tag\">因子投資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Susan Kare: Designing Icons &amp; Graphics For the Original Mac iconographer bitmap graphics proportionally spaced fonts cap height Letraset desktop metaphor\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-28-ycsp-mac-图标不是像素问题-是隐喻问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ba08e7524f0aad6b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">51:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0828</span></div>\n<h2>Mac 圖標不是像素問題，是隱喻問題</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">少畫幾筆，用戶才能把自己放進圖標裡。16×16 的黑白限制不是設計遺憾，而是逼出好想法的約束。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">圖標設計</span><span class=\"tag\">設計方法論</span>\n</div></div></a>"]